[Page:Spec-state]
PageContent= <h2 id="lives">Lives</h2> <p>The <code>#R$8003(lives)</code> variable holds the lives left. The <code>no_such_label</code> name is code that names no label, and stays as it is. A &#35;HTML macro name in prose is text.</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Name</th> <th>Holds</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>#R$8003(lives)</code></td> <td>the lives <em>left</em></td> </tr> </tbody> </table>

